function ktNorm(x){return String(x||'').toLowerCase().replace(/đ/g,'d').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'');}
function ktSec(mdText,names){var lines=String(mdText||'').split('\n'),out=[],on=false,lvl=0;
  for(var i=0;i<lines.length;i++){var m=lines[i].match(/^(#{1,4})\s+(.*)$/);
    if(m){if(on&&m[1].length<=lvl)break;if(!on&&names.some(function(n){return ktNorm(m[2]).indexOf(n)>=0;})){on=true;lvl=m[1].length;continue;}}
    if(on)out.push(lines[i]);}
  return out.join('\n').trim();}
